title: Guard
tags:
---
declare $favorability
Guard: Halt! Who goes there?

-> Get out of my way.
    <<jump AggressivePath>>
-> I’m a mercenary looking for work.
    <<jump MercenaryPath>>
-> I killed all the Ents, let me in.
    <<jump KillCheck>>

===

title: AggressivePath
---

Guard: Watch your tone, goblin. We don’t take kindly to threats around here.

<<if $favorability > 5>>
    Guard: Just for that you're a person of suspicion.  
    Guard: Go kill 7 Ents and maybe I’ll think about letting you in.
    <<set $killRequirement = 7>>

<<else>>
    Guard: You want in? Prove you’re not a threat.  
    Guard: Kill 4 Ents and come back.
    <<set $killRequirement = 4>>

<<jump KillCheck>>
<<endif>>
===

title: MercenaryPath
---

Guard: A mercenary? With that rusty sword and patchy gear?

<<if $favorability > 5>>
    Guard: You might be decent, but we still need to be cautious.  
    Guard: Kill 6 Ents to earn entry.
    <<set $killRequirement = 6>>

<<else>>
    Guard: If you want entry, I'll let you in for now for being nice.
    <<set $killRequirement = 0>>

<<jump KillCheck>>
<<endif>>
===

title: KillCheck
---

<<if $entKillCount >= $killRequirement>>
    Guard: Oh, you already got the kills. Well, you can go on in and talk to the village chief for work.
    Guard: Don’t cause any trouble.
    <<OpenVillageBarrier ToTown>>
<<elseif $killRequirement == 999>>
    Guard: OOH BRUTHER THIS GUY STINKS... 
    Guard: of lies.
<<else>>
    Guard: Come back after you've killed {$killRequirement} Ents.
<<endif>>

===

